  "details": "If I add a sound effect such as LowPass or HiPass to the AudioSource component to which I added the VRC AVPro Video Speaker script that comes with SDK3, it will either be silent or will always sound loudly in my ear.\nThere is no problem with the normal AudioSource component or the AudioSource component with the VRC Unity Video Player script added.\nMany of the club events held daily on VRChat are streamed live using AVPro, and since sound effects such as reverb and LowPass are not available, many creators use small techniques such as using reverb effects in the MainCamera component.\nPlease fix this.",
